Context('Numeric');
$C = random(0, 40, 1);
$F = NumberWithUnits(9/5*$C + 32, 'degF');

#############################
# Exercise Group Introduction
#############################

BEGIN_PGML
To convert a temperature in degrees Celsius to degrees Fahrenheit, there is a formula [`F = \frac95C + 32\text{.}`]

END_PGML

######
# Body
######

BEGIN_PGML
What Fahrenheit temperature is [`[$C]^{\circ}C\text{?}`]

[@KeyboardInstructions('Use [|degF|]* for degrees Fahrenheit.')@]**

[_]{$F}{10}

END_PGML

